OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785313146
OL,3,CMother of murdered teen launches
OL,4,Ccampaign to limit phone use
OL,6,FITV News Granada Reports' Mel Barham
OL,7,Freports on the 'Phones Down Summer
OL,8,FChallenge'.
OL,10,FThe mother of a murdered teenager has
OL,11,Flaunched a campaign encouraging people
OL,12,Fto put down their phones over summer,
OL,13,Fas research shows children are
OL,14,Fspending around 35 hours a week on
OL,15,Ftheir phone.
OL,17,FEsther Ghey has been campaigning for
OL,18,Fstricter phone use laws since her 16-
OL,19,Fyear-old daughter Brianna was murdered
OL,20,Fby two other teenagers in Warrington
OL,21,Fin 2023.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
