OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785313146
OL,3,CMother of murdered teen launches
OL,4,Ccampaign to limit phone use
OL,6,FThe Phones Down Summer Challenge has
OL,7,Fbeen launched by the Brianna Ghey
OL,8,Flegacy project, and hopes to show how
OL,9,Flocking devices away can have mental
OL,10,Fhealth benefits.
OL,12,FOlivia and Charlotte, 13, have agreed
OL,13,Fto take part in the challenge,
OL,14,Fpledging to come off of social media
OL,15,Ffor a whole week.
OL,17,FOlivia said: "It's quite bad but I
OL,18,Fprobably use my phone five to eight
OL,19,Fhours a day. That's on a school day so
OL,20,Fin the summer holidays maybe a bit
OL,21,Fmore.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785313146
OL,3,CMother of murdered teen launches
OL,4,Ccampaign to limit phone use
OL,6,FShe added: "I think it'll really
OL,7,Fbenefit a lot of us kids. I think
OL,8,Fwe'll come out being better people."
OL,10,FIt's hoped the digital detox will
OL,11,Fimprove mental health and reduce
OL,12,Fstress, encouraging more outdoor play.
OL,14,FEsther said: "I certainly felt like I
OL,15,Flost my children to the smartphone.
OL,16,FBrianna was really addicted to her
OL,17,Fphone and it's almost like we've lost
OL,18,Four children in this online world.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785313146
OL,3,CMother of murdered teen launches
OL,4,Ccampaign to limit phone use
OL,6,F"It's just an opportunity to become
OL,7,Fmore aware of that, become more
OL,8,Fmindful of how much we are using our
OL,9,Fphones and to also break the habit."
OL,11,FResearch has shown that children are
OL,12,Fspending around 35 hours a week on
OL,13,Ftheir phone, with some receiving up to
OL,14,F200 notifications a day.
OL,16,FIt also found that screen use just
OL,17,Fbefore bed has been linked to a loss
OL,18,Fof sleep at night.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
