PN,36905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785313146
OL,3,CMother of murdered teen launches
OL,4,Ccampaign to limit phone use
OL,6,FEsther previously said that during the
OL,7,Fthree years Brianna attended Birchwood
OL,8,FCommunity High School in Warrington,
OL,9,Fthere were 120 safeguarding logs and
OL,10,F116 behaviour logs around her phone
OL,11,Fuse.
OL,13,FShe has spoken out about the pressures
OL,14,Ffaced by teenagers in the digital age
OL,15,Fand the impact of cyberbullying and
OL,16,Fsocial isolation.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
